<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-asteroxylon-mackiei-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Asteroxylon mackiei Schnakenberg critical wavelength at 5.2 µm (Pass 1) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The steady state, Jacobian, quadratic growth rate, and the k_c formula are the Schnakenberg–Turing system, with D_u set by λ_c = 5.2 µm. Diffusion is integrated in Fourier space. The basic-look composite is a visualization on the fossil plate, not a claim that the PDE grows the compression from noise." ;
